                                "sense_id": "a2482a50-50e0-3fe5-9ae5-bfb97f4a56bf",
                                "text": "This genial melting of prejudices under the soft sunlights falling upon the hearts of the circle, was to me, the charm of this, and of the former evening: and was the best part of the entertainment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d43e575-43ec-416b-830d-18c8ccaae82c",
                                "sense_id": "a2482a50-50e0-3fe5-9ae5-bfb97f4a56bf",
                                "text": "Under the connecting feeling of tropical heat and vertical sunlights I brought together all creatures, birds, beasts, reptiles, all trees and plants, usages and appearances, that are found in all tropical regions, and assembled them together in China or Indostan."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a2636a8-f83d-4b4d-8eb6-139bf61d86dc",
                                "sense_id": "a2482a50-50e0-3fe5-9ae5-bfb97f4a56bf",
                                "text": "They did not build ships and beach on alien shores, and carry their flags and standards into new sunlights."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
